    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Shipping Retrieval API enables users to access a list of shipping options for items in an ecommerce cart. This API is essential for providing customers with various shipping methods and rates based on their selected products. It serves developers integrating with ecommerce platforms who need to present shipping information to users. Typical use cases include displaying shipping choices during checkout or helping customers estimate delivery times and costs. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance user experience and streamline the purchasing process.",
